		(uuid "78c90154-0a0f-4927-aff7-305c97ff3130")
		(at 128.75 127 90)
		(descr "OPSCO SK6812MINI-HS-012 addressable RGB LED, top-mount 3.5x3.5mm PLCC4, lens up (LCSC C2922787). Land pattern from the manufacturer datasheet SK6812MINI-HS-012 Rev B/0, section 6 (PCB recommended pad size, TOP VIEW): 1.5x1.0mm pads, 1.8mm gap between columns, 0.8mm gap between rows. Pad numbers are the datasheet pin numbers (section 5): 1=GND lower-right (chamfered corner), 2=DIN upper-right, 3=VDD upper-left, 4=DOUT lower-left. Body 3.7x3.5x1.95mm (section 4). The 3D model is KiCad's WS2812B-Mini 3535 PLCC4 body, rotated 180 degrees so its pin-1 corner sits on pad 1.")
